      "date": "2026-06-05T08:06:55.000Z",
      "title": "SURYODAY: Planned Equity And Debt Raises Will Support Bullish Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have lifted their fair value estimate for Suryoday Small Finance Bank slightly from ₹236 to ₹240, citing updated assumptions on discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E that together support a modestly higher target. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for May 07, 2026 to consider and approve audited financial results for Q4 and the full year ended March 31, 2026, and to consider a dividend recommendation and record date, as per a company filing.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
