      "date": "2026-05-08T16:47:52.000Z",
      "title": "Investor sentiment improves as stock rises 18%",
      "body": "After last week's 18% share price gain to ₹180, the stock trades at a forward P/E ratio of 8x. Average forward P/E is 10x in the Banks industry in India. Total returns to shareholders of 42% over the past three years.",
